    "Description.OSA.illegalContentReportNoViolation": "Hello,\nThank you for submitting an Online Safety Act  - Illegal Content report.\nAfter review of your submitted report, we have concluded that the content does not violate Roblox's Community Standards or cited local laws.As a result, we will not take action on the content you reported.\nTicket ID: {ticketID}\n\nIf you would like to appeal our decision,  please use the following case ID and link:\nCase ID: {caseID}\nAppeal Link: {appealLink}\n\nLearn more about your rights to appeal our decision: https://en.help.roblox.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000245263-Appeal-Your-Content-or-Account-Moderation.\nSincerely,\nThe Roblox Moderation Team",
    "Description.OSA.illegalContentReportAppealNewEmail": "Thank you for submitting an appeal under the UK Online Safety Act. We have received your submission and it is pending review. Our estimated timeframe for deciding appeals is within 5 business days. Please note this is only indicative, as it depends on many factors, including the complexity of the issues raised and how much relevant information you have included in your appeal. \nTicket ID: {ticketID}\nContent URL: {contentURL}\n\nFollowing our review of your appeal, we may decide to either uphold our initial decision or reverse it. \n\nYou will receive an update with our decision and details on any action taken to the contact email you provided.",
