    "Heading.BRWomen.illegalContentReportContentNoAction": "Reported Content Not Removed",
    "Description.BRWomen.illegalContentReportContentRemoved": "Hello,  \n\nWe reviewed the content you reported at {contentURL}. We found that it violates Roblox's Community Standards or applicable Brazilian law, and we have removed it.  Your identity as the reporter is kept confidential from other users.  \n\nIf you see this content again anywhere on Roblox, please submit a new report at https://www.roblox.com/illegal-content-reporting with the new location.\n\nSupport in Brazil: Centro de Atendimento à Mulher - Disque 180  \n\nSincerely, \nThe Roblox Moderation Team  \nTicket ID: {ticketID}",
    "Description.BRIntimate.illegalContentReportNewEmail": "Thank you for submitting a report on intimate content shared without consent at {contentURL}.  We have received your report and it is being reviewed.  \n\nWe aim to act on valid requests within 2 hours of receiving them, and to tell you the outcome within 2 hours of our decision. These are targets, not guarantees. Timing depends on factors including the complexity of the issues raised and how much relevant information your report contains.  \n\nWe will send any updates to the email address you gave us on the report form. Your identity as the reporter is kept confidential from other users.  You do not need to reply to this email or send us anything further.  \n\nFor information support in Brazil, we encourage you to reach out to Centro de Atendimento à Mulher - Disque 180  \n\nTicket ID: {ticketID}",
    "Description.BRIntimate.illegalContentReportNoViolation": "Hello,\n\nWe reviewed the content you reported at {contentURL}. We found that it does not violate Roblox's Community Standards or applicable Brazilian law.\n\nAs a result, we will not take action on the content or conduct you reported.  If you disagree with this decision, you can contest it. Use case ID {caseID} at {appealLink}.  Your identity as the reporter is kept confidential from other users.  \n\nSupport in Brazil: Centro de Atendimento à Mulher - Disque 180\n\nSincerely, \nThe Roblox Moderation Team  \nTicket ID: {ticketID}",
    "Description.BRIntimate.illegalContentReportContentRemoved": "Hello,  \n\nWe reviewed the content you reported at {contentURL}. We found that it violates Roblox's Community Standards or applicable Brazilian law, and we have removed it.  Your identity as the reporter is kept confidential from other users.  \n\nIf you see this content again anywhere on Roblox, please submit a new report at https://www.roblox.com/illegal-content-reporting with the new location.\n\nSupport in Brazil: Centro de Atendimento à Mulher - Disque 180  \n\nSincerely, \nThe Roblox Moderation Team  \nTicket ID: {ticketID}",
    "Description.BRIntimate.illegalContentReportUserModerated": "Hello,\n\nWe reviewed the report you submitted about the content at {contentURL}. We found that it violates Roblox's Community Standards or applicable Brazilian law. \n\nThe user has been moderated.  We cannot share further detail about the action taken on another user's account.  Your identity as the reporter is kept confidential from other users.  \n\nIf you see similar content again anywhere on Roblox, please submit a new report at https://www.roblox.com/illegal-content-reporting with the location.  \n\nSupport in Brazil: Centro de Atendimento à Mulher - Disque 180  \n\nSincerely, \nThe Roblox Moderation Team  \nTicket ID: {ticketID}",
    "Description.BRIntimate.illegalContentReportGeneralInquires": "Hello,  \n\nWe were not able to review the report you submitted because we could not locate the content.  \n\nTo look into this, please submit a new report at https://www.roblox.com/illegal-content-reporting that includes:  \nA single Roblox web address showing where the content appears. \nA link to the specific experience, item, or profile page works best. \nYour name and a contact email address. \nPlease put the web address in the form field rather than in a reply to this email. \nWe are not able to accept files, screenshots, or attachments.  Your identity as the reporter is kept confidential from other users.  \n\nSupport in Brazil: Centro de Atendimento à Mulher - Disque 180  \n\nSincerely, \nThe Roblox Moderation Team  \nTicket ID: {ticketID}",
    "Description.BRIntimate.illegalContentReportInsufficientInfo": "Hello,  \n\nWe were not able to review the report you submitted because we could not locate the content.  \n\nTo look into this, please submit a new report at https://www.roblox.com/illegal-content-reporting that includes:  \nA single Roblox web address showing where the content appears. \nA link to the specific experience, item, or profile page works best. \nYour name and a contact email address. \nPlease put the web address in the form field rather than in a reply to this email. \nWe are not able to accept files, screenshots, or attachments.  Your identity as the reporter is kept confidential from other users.  \n\nSupport in Brazil: Centro de Atendimento à Mulher - Disque 180  \n\nSincerely, \nThe Roblox Moderation Team  \nTicket ID: {ticketID}",
    "Description.BRIntimate.illegalContentReportContentRemoval": "Hello,  \n\nWe reviewed the content you reported at {contentURL}. We found that it violates Roblox's Community Standards or applicable Brazilian law, and we have removed it.  Your identity as the reporter is kept confidential from other users.  \n\nIf you see this content again anywhere on Roblox, please submit a new report at https://www.roblox.com/illegal-content-reporting with the new location.\n\nSupport in Brazil: Centro de Atendimento à Mulher - Disque 180  \n\nSincerely, \nThe Roblox Moderation Team  \nTicket ID: {ticketID}",
    "Description.BRIntimate.illegalContentReportContentNoAction": "Hello,  \n\nWe received a report about content you posted at {contentURL}.  We reviewed the content and found that it does not violate Roblox's Community Standards or applicable Brazilian law. \n\nAs a result, we will not take action on the content, and it remains available on Roblox.  No action is needed from you. This report will not count against your account.  We do not share the identity of people who submit reports.  \n\nSincerely, \nThe Roblox Moderation Team  \nTicket ID: {ticketID}",
    "Description.BRIntimate.illegalContentReportLackStanding": "Hello,  \n\nThank you for your report about the content at {contentURL}.  \n\nThis reporting channel is for people who appear in intimate content that was shared without their consent, and for people authorised to act on their behalf. Based on the information in your report, we were not able to confirm that this applies to you, so we cannot process it through this channel.  \n\nThere are other ways to raise this:  \nIf the person shown in the content wants to report it, or has authorised you to do so, submit a new report at https://www.roblox.com/illegal-content-reporting. \nIf the content involves online gender-based violence, you can use the women-safety option at https://www.roblox.com/illegal-content-reporting. \nFor anything else, follow the steps at https://en.help.roblox.com/hc/en-us/articles/203312410-How-to-Report-Rule-Violations \n\nSupport in Brazil: Centro de Atendimento à Mulher - Disque 180 \n\nSincerely, \nThe Roblox Moderation Team  \nTicket ID: {ticketID}",
    "Heading.BRIntimate.illegalContentReportNewEmail": "Illegal Content Report - Automated Reply to Newly Created Tickets",
